      "content": "hey so i just got my bloodwork back from the clinic and my inr is 4.2... my doctor wont call me back until tomorrow morning and im kinda freaked out. is there anything i can take or eat right now to get that number down a bit so it's not so high? i dont want to end up bleeding or something",
