      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know, but like 4.2 feels super high and i'm already seeing some bruising on my legs. i'm just really anxious about waiting until tomorrow. can't i just take some extra vitamin k or something? i read online that kelp supplements or lots of spinach can help balance it out. is that a safe thing to do just tonight? i just want to feel some control over this.",
