      "content": "It is very important that you do not take extra Vitamin K or increase your intake of high-Vitamin K foods like spinach or kelp without consulting your healthcare provider first. These substances can significantly interfere with your blood thinners and could make your INR drop unexpectedly, which is also risky. Focus on keeping calm until your doctor calls back, as they are the only ones who can give you safe guidance for this situation. If the bruising is increasing rapidly or you have other signs of bleeding, please call your clinic right away.",
